WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.919
Joe Goldberg is back

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:04.171
and he hasn't changed
one bit.

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:06.048
You know the drill by now.

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:07.925
We'll be explaining
all you need to know

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.135
about the ending
of You season 3.

00:00:10.219 --> 00:00:11.929
So, go make sure
you're all caught up

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.680
before
you continue watching.

00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:16.141
The very final scene
of season 3

00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:18.227
teases Joe's next steps,

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.687
but before we dig into that
we need to rewind

00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:22.898
and take a look
at how he got here.

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:25.943
Starting with his new
and unfamiliar environment,

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.110
suburbia.

00:00:27.194 --> 00:00:30.113
Which, as we well know,
is Joe's idea of hell.

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:33.325
We're in this fake,
plastic suburban hell.

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:35.452
We moved here for the baby.

00:00:35.536 --> 00:00:37.746
Two extra things come
with his personal nightmare

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:39.456
in the aspirational
neighbourhood

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:40.832
of Madre Linda.

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:43.210
His wife,
Love Quinn Goldberg

00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:44.461
and new born son, Henry,

00:00:44.545 --> 00:00:47.714
also known as Forty
after Love's deceased twin,

00:00:47.798 --> 00:00:49.716
much to Joe's annoyance.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.426
Welcome home, Forty.

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:53.303
Maybe we can use
his real name.

00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:56.056
New parenthood
may be exhausting

00:00:56.139 --> 00:00:58.267
for Madre Linda's
new murderous couple,

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.395
but Joe still finds the time
to develop a new obsession

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:02.604
with their attractive

00:01:02.688 --> 00:01:04.773
and flirtatious neighbour,
Natalie.

00:01:04.857 --> 00:01:05.816
You're nervous.

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:07.693
Got a chequered past
you're trying hide?

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:09.278
While some habits die hard,

00:01:09.361 --> 00:01:12.531
suburban Joe, it seems,
is not as prone to murder

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:15.033
as Joe in New York
and Joe in LA,

00:01:15.117 --> 00:01:17.494
AKA the Joe's
of previous seasons.

00:01:17.578 --> 00:01:19.413
In fact,
he doesn't kill anyone

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:21.206
until the last episode
but one.

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:22.499
More on that later.

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:25.836
The same, however,
can't be said for his wife.

00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:28.505
As a result,

00:01:28.589 --> 00:01:31.175
suburban Joe
spends most of this season

00:01:31.258 --> 00:01:33.260
covering up his wife's
murders and misdeeds.

00:01:33.343 --> 00:01:35.345
Love starts
with murdering Natalie

00:01:35.429 --> 00:01:36.930
shortly after finding a box

00:01:37.014 --> 00:01:38.724
full
of Natalie-related trinkets

00:01:38.807 --> 00:01:40.058
collected by Joe.

00:01:40.142 --> 00:01:41.894
She later attacks
mild-mannered

00:01:41.977 --> 00:01:43.520
local geology professor,
Gil,

00:01:43.604 --> 00:01:46.148
when he admits
his unvaccinated children

00:01:46.231 --> 00:01:48.442
gave Henry/ Forty
the measles.

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:51.528
When he kills himself
in the now infamous cage

00:01:51.612 --> 00:01:53.739
after she and Joe
dig up dirt on his son,

00:01:53.822 --> 00:01:55.866
they pin
Natalie's murder on him,

00:01:55.949 --> 00:01:56.992
successfully throwing

00:01:57.075 --> 00:01:58.577
Madre Linda's
nosy neighbours

00:01:58.660 --> 00:01:59.912
off their scent,

00:01:59.995 --> 00:02:02.080
as well as, crucially,
the police.

00:02:02.164 --> 00:02:03.373
All that is undone

00:02:03.457 --> 00:02:06.376
when, during a swinging
party gone array,

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.920
Love let's
Natalie's murder slip

00:02:08.003 --> 00:02:10.047
within earshot
of Madre Linda power couple,

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.465
Sherry and Cary.

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:13.425
-I killed Natalie for you!
-Shut up!

00:02:16.303 --> 00:02:17.471
Go.

00:02:17.554 --> 00:02:18.805
In the box they go

00:02:18.889 --> 00:02:21.600
where they're discovered
by Natalie's stepson, Theo,

00:02:21.683 --> 00:02:24.561
a lovesick teenager
fixated on Love

00:02:24.645 --> 00:02:25.896
who's been more than happy

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:27.523
to encourage
that attraction.

00:02:28.482 --> 00:02:30.651
Despite seeming
to care about him,

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:32.778
she attacks him
to protect her secret,

00:02:32.861 --> 00:02:34.404
leaving him
for Joe to deal with.

00:02:35.489 --> 00:02:37.324
So, it is safe to say

00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:40.577
Love Quinn Goldberg
is more than a match for Joe

00:02:40.661 --> 00:02:43.247
and with a murderous wife,
and obsession of Joe's

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:44.706
is faced
with a double threat,

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:47.543
being stalked by him
or killed by Love.

00:02:47.626 --> 00:02:49.503
I think we need to go
to couple's therapy.

00:02:51.296 --> 00:02:52.339
Enter Marienne,

00:02:52.422 --> 00:02:54.091
Joe's boss
at the local library.

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:56.468
Their relationship
is initially frosty,

00:02:56.552 --> 00:02:59.680
but thaws over of the season
as the two get closer.

00:02:59.763 --> 00:03:01.682
We learn she's
a divorced single mother

00:03:01.765 --> 00:03:02.724
and a former addict.

00:03:02.808 --> 00:03:05.477
Part of the reason
Joe fixates on her so much

00:03:05.561 --> 00:03:06.562
is because he believes

00:03:06.645 --> 00:03:08.814
they have shared
similar struggles in life,

00:03:08.897 --> 00:03:10.983
and with that,
he has a new target.

00:03:11.066 --> 00:03:12.985
Aside from
the homicidal wife,

00:03:13.068 --> 00:03:14.862
there is another man
standing in the way

00:03:14.945 --> 00:03:15.863
of what Joe wants.

00:03:15.946 --> 00:03:19.533
Local reporter, Ryan,
is Marienne's ex-husband,

00:03:19.616 --> 00:03:21.994
gaming the system
to prevent her from getting

00:03:22.077 --> 00:03:23.620
full custody
of her daughter.

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.289
Marienne makes it clear

00:03:25.372 --> 00:03:27.332
any relationship
between the two of them

00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:28.709
cannot happen

00:03:28.792 --> 00:03:31.336
because he would use
her being with a married man

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.422
as a reason
to withhold her daughter.

00:03:33.505 --> 00:03:34.381
And this is where

00:03:34.464 --> 00:03:36.091
Joe decides
it's time to kill.

00:03:36.592 --> 00:03:38.510
Not for Love,
not for his son,

00:03:38.594 --> 00:03:39.761
but for Marienne.

00:03:39.845 --> 00:03:40.929
It's for her.

00:03:41.972 --> 00:03:43.140
With Ryan out of the way,

00:03:43.223 --> 00:03:45.434
he decides it's time
to ask Love for a divorce

00:03:45.517 --> 00:03:48.145
so he can run away
with Marienne and Juliette.

00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:51.356
But Love isn't going to
let him leave that easily.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:53.609
And it turns out,
she too has form

00:03:53.692 --> 00:03:55.652
in the whole killing
romantic partners area.

00:03:55.736 --> 00:03:57.196
Remember
her deceased husband

00:03:57.279 --> 00:03:58.363
in season 2?

00:03:58.447 --> 00:04:00.991
The official story
was he died of cancer,

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:02.284
but Love confesses

00:04:02.367 --> 00:04:04.494
that the truth
is much more sinister.

00:04:04.578 --> 00:04:05.495
I did kill him.

00:04:06.872 --> 00:04:07.831
But I didn't mean to.

00:04:07.915 --> 00:04:09.333
It was my first time
using it

00:04:10.125 --> 00:04:10.959
and...

00:04:12.044 --> 00:04:14.880
the dosage was too high
when ingested.

00:04:16.381 --> 00:04:18.133
What dosage was too high?

00:04:18.717 --> 00:04:19.843
Aconite.

00:04:20.427 --> 00:04:23.138
-You wanted to paralyse him.
-You don't have to worry.

00:04:25.641 --> 00:04:26.975
This time I'm letting it

00:04:27.684 --> 00:04:28.894
absorb through the skin.

00:04:28.977 --> 00:04:31.480
Oh, no. No, no, no, no, no.

00:04:31.563 --> 00:04:32.397
Paralysing Joe

00:04:32.481 --> 00:04:34.525
with aconite farmed
from a wolfsbane plant

00:04:34.608 --> 00:04:36.610
she's been tending
whole season,

00:04:36.693 --> 00:04:38.946
Love plots
to kill her rival, Marienne.

00:04:39.029 --> 00:04:40.447
When he's
obsessed with someone,

00:04:40.531 --> 00:04:41.990
he'll do anything
for them...

00:04:42.074 --> 00:04:42.908
I should know.

00:04:44.368 --> 00:04:45.702
He was obsessed with me.

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:47.955
Until he met you.

00:04:48.539 --> 00:04:49.414
Mum?

00:04:49.498 --> 00:04:51.041
...but she has
a change of heart

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:52.000
after seeing Juliette

00:04:52.084 --> 00:04:55.003
and it's here, it seems,
Joe's time is up.

00:04:55.087 --> 00:04:56.547
I'm not the problem.

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.173
My husband is the problem.

00:05:01.176 --> 00:05:02.678
Unfortunately for Love,

00:05:02.761 --> 00:05:04.680
Joe has been
one step ahead of her

00:05:04.763 --> 00:05:06.181
the whole time.

00:05:06.265 --> 00:05:09.017
He injects her with his own
lethal dosage of aconite,

00:05:09.101 --> 00:05:11.687
admitting he knew she would
attempt something like this,

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:13.730
taking
some adrenaline tablets

00:05:13.814 --> 00:05:15.482
to fend off
the effects of the poison.

00:05:15.566 --> 00:05:16.608
Love dies

00:05:16.692 --> 00:05:19.945
still insisting the two
are a match made in heaven.

00:05:20.529 --> 00:05:23.156
We're perfect
for each other.

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:25.492
And, well,
she's probably not wrong.

00:05:25.576 --> 00:05:27.244
Thanks to his staging
of the scene,

00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:29.997
everyone believes
Joe is dead at Love's hands.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.498
He cuts off his own toes,

00:05:31.582 --> 00:05:33.333
leaving one baked in a pie

00:05:33.417 --> 00:05:35.627
at the charred remains
of his family home.

00:05:35.711 --> 00:05:37.129
All of the attacks
and murders

00:05:37.212 --> 00:05:38.755
around Madre Linda,

00:05:38.839 --> 00:05:40.424
including
that of reporter Ryan,

00:05:40.507 --> 00:05:43.886
are pinned on her,
leaving Joe free and clear.

00:05:43.969 --> 00:05:45.721
Sherry and Cary
survive the cage

00:05:45.804 --> 00:05:47.806
by finding
the spare key inside

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:49.892
and make a killing
out of their experience.

00:05:50.434 --> 00:05:51.435
Theo too survives

00:05:51.518 --> 00:05:53.687
when Joe decides
to take him to a hospital,

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:56.815
instead of killing him
and clearing up Love's mess.

00:05:56.899 --> 00:05:59.401
And little Henry
is given a new home

00:05:59.484 --> 00:06:01.486
with Joe's
library colleague, Dante.

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.822
So, where has Joe gone next?

00:06:03.906 --> 00:06:05.741
He can't return
to New York or LA,

00:06:05.824 --> 00:06:07.993
two places
filled with his skeletons

00:06:08.076 --> 00:06:10.245
and where people
would likely recognise him.

00:06:10.329 --> 00:06:13.498
So, a new country
and city it is.

00:06:13.582 --> 00:06:17.085
As that skyline makes clear,
Joe ends season 3 in Paris.

00:06:17.169 --> 00:06:18.337
Why Paris?

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:20.506
Well, if you remember
earlier in the season,

00:06:20.589 --> 00:06:22.716
Marienne tells Joe
she grew up there

00:06:22.799 --> 00:06:24.593
and dreams
of taking Juliette there

00:06:24.676 --> 00:06:27.137
away from Ryan
and away from Madre Linda.

00:06:27.221 --> 00:06:28.138
I was born in Paris.

00:06:28.222 --> 00:06:29.056
Once again,

00:06:29.139 --> 00:06:31.517
Joe Goldberg follows a woman
to a brand new city

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.310
with a brand new name
and identity.

00:06:33.393 --> 00:06:35.187
Will he find Marienne?

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:37.564
Well, that's a question
for another time.

00:06:38.232 --> 00:06:40.817
What did you make
of the newest season of You?

00:06:40.901 --> 00:06:43.195
Let us know in the comments
and for more breakdowns

00:06:43.278 --> 00:06:44.988
of your favourite
Netflix shows,

00:06:45.072 --> 00:06:46.698
make sure you subscribe
to the channel.

